<title>USA: Century Communications sets $250 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Century Communications sets $250 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Century Communications Corp was priced on Friday, according to sole manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p>BORROWER CENTURY COMMUNICATIONS CORP</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	 COUPON 8.875 PCT  MATURITY 01/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 98.605  FIRST PAY DATE 07/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BA3   YIELD 9.09 PCT    PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB-MINUS  SPREAD 255 BP     CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>(( - U.S. corporate bond unit 212-859-1678))</p>
</text>
